    "id": "phy_m4",
    "title": "《九霄传波诀》",
    "tier": "选必一",
    "chapter": "第三章 机械波",
    "summary": "横波与纵波、波速波长频率关系、波形图与振动图的区别。",
    "content": "<div class=\"dlg-shifu\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b6f4722,#8b6f4711);border-left:4px solid #8b6f47;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\"><b style=\"color:#8b6f47\">🧙‍♂️ 师傅：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">徒儿，今日为师传你 <b>《九霄传波诀》</b>，此篇属于<b>选必一·第三章 机械波</b>，乃高考必考之根本。</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8b6f4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #8b6f47;color:#5a4a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🌟 一、引道·核心要义</h3><p>横波与纵波、波速波长频率关系、波形图与振动图的区别。</p><div class=\"dlg-shimei\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f4a3c822,#f4a3c811);border-left:4px solid #f4a3c8;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\"><b style=\"color:#f4a3c8\">🎀 师妹：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">师姐，这一篇该从哪里入手？</span></div><div class=\"dlg-shijie\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c67ecb22,#c67ecb11);border-left:4px solid #c67ecb;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\"><b style=\"color:#c67ecb\">🌸 师姐：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">先记住<b>横波质点振动垂直传播方向（水波、绳波）</b>——这是整个知识点的入口。</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8b6f4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #8b6f47;color:#5a4a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">📖 二、拆经·关键要点</h3><ul style=\"padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9\"><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 横波质点振动垂直传播方向（水波、绳波）</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 纵波质点振动沿传播方向（声波）</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 波速 v=λf</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 波形图 y-x 是空间快照，振动图 y-t 是时间演变</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 波传递能量和信息，质点不随波迁移</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8b6f4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #8b6f47;color:#5a4a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🎨 三、图解·公式全景</h3><div style=\"margin:10px 0;padding:14px 18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff9e6,#fff4d1);border:1px dashed #d4a545;border-radius:10px;font-family:'KaiTi','STKaiti',serif;font-size:16px;text-align:center;color:#7a5a20\"><b>📜 v=λf</b></div><div style=\"margin:10px 0;padding:14px 18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff9e6,#fff4d1);border:1px dashed #d4a545;border-radius:10px;font-family:'KaiTi','STKaiti',serif;font-size:16px;text-align:center;color:#7a5a20\"><b>📜 v=λ/T</b></div><div style=\"margin:10px 0;padding:14px 18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff9e6,#fff4d1);border:1px dashed #d4a545;border-radius:10px;font-family:'KaiTi','STKaiti',serif;font-size:16px;text-align:center;color:#7a5a20\"><b>📜 相邻同相点距离=λ</b></div><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8b6f4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #8b6f47;color:#5a4a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🔥 四、演道·经典例题</h3><p><b>例题</b>：波长 λ=2m，频率 f=50Hz，则波速 v=100m/s</p><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8b6f4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #8b6f47;color:#5a4a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">💬 五、对话·师徒印证</h3><div class=\"dlg-shixiong\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4a7fc822,#4a7fc811);border-left:4px solid #4a7fc8;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\"><b style=\"color:#4a7fc8\">⚔️ 大师兄：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">记住这几个公式：<b>v=λf</b>。高考几乎每年都要在这里设坑。</span></div><div class=\"dlg-shimei\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f4a3c822,#f4a3c811);border-left:4px solid #f4a3c8;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\"><b style=\"color:#f4a3c8\">🎀 师妹：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">坑在哪里？</span></div><div class=\"dlg-shixiong\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4a7fc822,#4a7fc811);border-left:4px solid #4a7fc8;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\"><b style=\"color:#4a7fc8\">⚔️ 大师兄：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">最常见的是<b>符号弄反</b>、<b>单位不统一</b>、<b>矢量方向</b>。做题时先画图，标好正方向！</span></div><div class=\"dlg-shifu\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b6f4722,#8b6f4711);border-left:4px solid #8b6f47;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\"><b style=\"color:#8b6f47\">🧙‍♂️ 师傅：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">再补一句：<b>波传递能量和信息，质点不随波迁移</b>——这是本篇的\"心法\"，考试时思路要先转到这里。</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8b6f4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #8b6f47;color:#5a4a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🎯 六、印证·真题范式</h3><p>本篇高考真题主要围绕 <b>横波质点振动垂直传播方向（水波、绳波）</b> 与 <b>纵波质点振动沿传播方向（声波）</b> 展开。做题三步走：<br>① 读题识模型 → ② 画图标已知 → ③ 选公式求解。</p><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8b6f4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #8b6f47;color:#5a4a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🧘 七、参悟·记忆口诀</h3><div style=\"margin:10px 0;padding:14px 18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff9e6,#fff4d1);border:1px dashed #d4a545;border-radius:10px;font-family:'KaiTi','STKaiti',serif;font-size:16px;text-align:center;color:#7a5a20\"><b>📜 机械波传播要牢记，关键公式 v=λf；符号方向莫弄反，多画图形少出错。</b></div><div class=\"dlg-shifu\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b6f4722,#8b6f4711);border-left:4px solid #8b6f47;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\"><b style=\"color:#8b6f47\">🧙‍♂️ 师傅：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">徒儿，此篇秘籍关乎你在雷霆殿的功力，务必参透！</span></div>",
